- Caching of reccurent and constant infos at least: 
    - Currencies
    - Units
    - Permissions


Resource design
    list of products doesn't include variants 
    product detail include variants
    list of variants doesn't include product since you need product_id to do it
    variant detail need the product detail but without other variants to avoid loop
    create a product do all the things needed
    update a product, update the product and sync categories so product + categories (sans variants and optionValues) in response
    create a variant would be bulk so list of the all variants without product relation
    update a variant would be for unique and could cause inconsistence with creation but variant detail + unit only, prices will have his own, addmany-update-deletemany


