CATEGORY
[x] GET    /categories                  → list (avec parent si besoin de l'arbre)
[x] POST   /categories                  → create > category
[x] GET    /categories/{id}             → show > category + parent + children
[x] PATCH  /categories/{id}             → update > category
[x] DELETE /categories/{id}             → delete

PRODUCTS
[x] GET    /products                    → list (categories + optionValues, sans variants)
[ ] POST   /products                    → create > product complet (actu manque show inventory-item)
[x] GET    /products/{id}               → show > product + categories + optionValues + variants
[x] PATCH  /products/{id}               → update (infos + sync categories) > product + categories
[ ] DELETE /products/{id}               → delete

VARIANTS
[x] GET    /products/{id}/variants      → list (sans product)
[x] POST   /products/{id}/variants      → bulk create > liste des variants du produit (sans product)
[x] GET    /variants/{id}               → show > variant complet + product light
[x] PATCH  /variants/{id}               → update > variant + unit (sans product, sans prices)
[ ] DELETE /variants/{id}               → delete

CURRENCIES (only list)
[x] GET    /currencies                  → list

UNITS
[x] GET    /units                      → list
[x] POST   /units/sync                 → create & update
[ ] DELETE /units                      → delete

OPTIONS
[x] GET    /options                     → list (sans values)
[x] POST   /options                     → create (avec values) > option + values
[x] GET    /options/{id}                → show > option + values
[x] PATCH  /options/{id}                → update (infos + sync values, supprime liaisons orphelines) > option + values
[x] DELETE /options/{id}                → delete options and values



